  "steps": [
    "Current cue location focuses the correct form row. Three saved matches of the same UUID open different exact JSON tokens, including an escaped UUID after Chinese/emoji in BOM/CRLF text. Inspection is readonly, adds no HTTP read, keeps the audio document and approved draft, and changes no author files.",
    "Chinese/English/Japanese at 390px preserve the same readonly node, exact selection, focus, scroll and approved edit. The source can be collapsed without closing the parent form; cancellation preserves audio draft and files.",
    "Cue navigation follows stable identities after reorder, target changes, deletion and new cue creation; detached buttons cannot jump to replacement rows. Incomplete numeric text survives source inspection. Switching tracks or hiding usage clears the source preview.",
    "The viewer explicitly shows the last-read saved snapshot. External behavior edits appear only after refresh; refresh clears old text immediately, late responses never reopen it, old buttons stay invalid, and failure/retry preserves approval. Closing/reopening cannot resurrect the old source.",
    "Inspection also works over an already unsaved ordinary audio draft. Cancel retains it, Apply remains independent, and ordinary Save writes only the reviewed audio change with BOM/CRLF preserved; behavior and all other author files are unchanged."
  ],
